#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
hyperRouter — an OmniRoute-style free-model router for OpenCode, Freebuff, and
DeepSeek Harness.

It discovers free models, classifies the task, picks a model, builds/enriches
prompts, and exposes an OpenAI-compatible endpoint with account rotation,
quota tracking, cooldowns, and failover.

Core ideas are ported from OmniRoute (MIT):
  https://github.com/cheaper-inference/OmniRoute
The free-model catalog also merges models.dev metadata (MIT):
  https://models.dev

This tool does NOT bypass provider-side limits. "Bypassing token limits" here
means pooling multiple free accounts/keys, tracking each quota, rotating, and
failing over. If every account is exhausted, requests fail honestly.
"""

